  m_text: "If you are reading this letter, you must be another one of Gothel\u2019s
    victims. I have escaped before and you shall do the same.\n\r\nThe way out lies
    hidden in plain sight. Two flames guard the path to truth, yet only one burns
    with purpose. The left reveals what was forgotten. The right grants the eye to
    see it.\r\nBut be warned \u2014 not all who see, understand.\n\r\n\u2014 Repunzel.\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
